<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 64px', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif', background: '#F8FAFC' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6 0%, #06B6D4 100%)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>系统架构</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 4 }}>五层职责边界清晰，每层只依赖下一层的契约</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, height: 520 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 648, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 16, padding: '16px 18px', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>分层架构</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#94A3B8' }}>自上而下调用，自下而上供数</Text>
      </Box>
      <svg width="612" height="452" viewBox="0 0 612 452">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="gArch" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stopColor="#3B82F6" />
            <stop offset="100%" stopColor="#06B6D4" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>

        <g>
          <rect x="0" y="6" width="84" height="78" rx="10" fill="#0F172A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="40" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">前端层</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="60" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="10" fill="#94A3B8">React 18</text>
          <rect x="94" y="24" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#BFDBFE" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="174" y="50" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">六页工作台 + 路由</text>
          <rect x="262" y="24" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#BFDBFE" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="342" y="50" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">FlowContext 跨页流转</text>
          <rect x="430" y="24" width="182" height="42" rx="8" fill="#EFF6FF" stroke="#BFDBFE" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="521" y="50" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">Mock / 真实后端双模</text>
        </g>

        <g>
          <rect x="0" y="92" width="84" height="78" rx="10" fill="#0F172A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="126" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">接口层</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="146" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="10" fill="#94A3B8">FastAPI</text>
          <rect x="94" y="110" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#F0FDFA" stroke="#99F6E4" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="174" y="136" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#0F766E">21 个路由 / 22 方法</text>
          <rect x="262" y="110" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#F0FDFA" stroke="#99F6E4" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="342" y="136" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#0F766E">JWT 鉴权与越权拦截</text>
          <rect x="430" y="110" width="182" height="42" rx="8" fill="#F0FDFA" stroke="#99F6E4" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="521" y="136" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#0F766E">SSE 流式生成</text>
        </g>

        <g>
          <rect x="0" y="178" width="84" height="78" rx="10" fill="url(#gArch)" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="212" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">能力层</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="232" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="10" fill="#E0F2FE">核心逻辑</text>
          <rect x="94" y="196" width="120" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#93C5FD" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="154" y="222" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">RAG 两阶段检索</text>
          <rect x="222" y="196" width="120" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#93C5FD" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="282" y="222" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">生成与多版本</text>
          <rect x="350" y="196" width="120" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#93C5FD" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="410" y="222" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">三平台适配规则</text>
          <rect x="478" y="196" width="134" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#93C5FD" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="545" y="222" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#1E40AF">热点聚合与打分</text>
        </g>

        <g>
          <rect x="0" y="264" width="84" height="78" rx="10" fill="#0F172A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="298" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">数据层</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="318" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="10" fill="#94A3B8">存储与索引</text>
          <rect x="94" y="282" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#CBD5E1" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="174" y="308" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#334155">SQLite · 14 张表</text>
          <rect x="262" y="282" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#CBD5E1" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="342" y="308" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#334155">FAISS 向量索引</text>
          <rect x="430" y="282" width="182" height="42" rx="8" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#CBD5E1" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="521" y="308" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#334155">字段级 Fernet 加密</text>
        </g>

        <g>
          <rect x="0" y="350" width="84" height="78" rx="10" fill="#0F172A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="384" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">采集层</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="42" y="404" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="10" fill="#94A3B8">外部数据</text>
          <rect x="94" y="368" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFBEB" stroke="#FDE68A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="174" y="394" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#92400E">六源适配器链</text>
          <rect x="262" y="368" width="160" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFBEB" stroke="#FDE68A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="342" y="394" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#92400E">分源调度 + 熔断</text>
          <rect x="430" y="368" width="182" height="42" rx="8" fill="#FFFBEB" stroke="#FDE68A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="521" y="394" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11.5" fill="#92400E">微博 / 知乎 / 百度 / 抖音 / B站 / 头条</text>
        </g>

        <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="306" y="446" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#94A3B8">冷启动无 LLM Key 时能力层降级为模板生成，接口契约不变——这是可离线演示的前提</text>
      </svg>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 14, padding: '14px 18px', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.05)' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 16, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>两阶段检索</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#475569', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          向量召回候选池（同领域优先），再按风格与领域重排取 Top-5。关闭重排后命中率跌到 61.1%，重排贡献 +38.9pp。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 14, padding: '14px 18px', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.05)' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 16, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>字段级加密</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#475569', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          正文与敏感字段加密落库，检索只走索引与标题。这样加密不牺牲检索能力，越权请求也读不到明文。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 14, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 16, background: '#06B6D4', borderRadius: 2 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>流式与降级</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#CBD5E1', marginTop: 6, lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          SSE 边生成边推送，首字节即见文本；无 Key 时同一路由降级为模板生成，前端无需改一行代码。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, borderRadius: 2, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>AI 自媒体内容创作助手 · 项目汇报</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>07 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
